998.","extract_html":"<p><b>Annie Elizabeth Lintzenich Andrews</b> is an American pediatrician and politician who is the United States senator-elect from South Carolina. A member of the Democratic Party, Andrews is the first woman elected to the United States Senate from South Carolina and the first Democrat to win a U.S. Senate election in South Carolina since 1998.</p>"}